    <p>This section focuses on The Boring Company’s tunnel boring machines (especially the Prufrock series), autonomous systems, liner trucks, power delivery, and other vehicles or equipment shown in official posts and videos.</p>
    <h2 style="margin-top: 2rem; font-size: 1.2rem;">What you will find here</h2>
    <ul style="margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem 1.25rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
      <li>Prufrock design and performance updates from official sources</li>
      <li>Autonomous ring building and related demonstrations</li>
      <li>Support equipment (liner trucks, conveyors, power systems)</li>
      <li>Factory and test activity in Bastrop when publicly shared</li>
